        "summary": "A refined on-air identity for S4C's football programme, and a full motion system to carry it: from first look to air in six weeks, ready for the 2026–27 season opener.",
        "summary_cy": "Hunaniaeth ar yr awyr wedi'i mireinio i raglen bêl-droed S4C, a system symud lawn i'w chario: o'r sylw cyntaf i'r awyr mewn chwe wythnos, yn barod at agoriad tymor 2026–27.",
